{
  "name": "命源刺青 Lifewell Tattoo",
  "type": "equipment",
  "img": "icons/tools/scribal/burnisher-tooth.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"wordsection1\"><span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">覆盖区域：两条肢体，或者胸膛，或者上背部</span></p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"wordsection1\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM:12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">该魔法刺青用一根特殊的针制作，绘有生命与重生的符号。</span><span><br /></span><em><strong>刺青同调。</strong></em> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">同调此物品时，你需要将针持握，并抵在你想要让刺</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">青出现的那处皮肤上。当同调完成时，针头会化为墨水再变成刺青。若你与刺青的同调结束，刺青会消失，针头会再次出现在你的位置中。</span> <span><br /></span><span class=\"GramE\"><em><strong>黯蚀抗性</strong></em></span><em><strong> 。</strong></em><strong> </strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">你获得</span><span class=\"GramE\">对黯蚀伤害</span>的抗性。 <br /><em><strong>生命结界。</strong></em> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">当你生命值降至</span> <span>0 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">时，改为生命值降至</span> 1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。使用后，直到下次黎明前，此属性不能再次使用。</span></p></div></div>",
